 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/07/24 04:39| 01 | 180| 066| 0229| 0048| 0163| 0316|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/07/23 18:36| 03 | 015| 056| 0152| 0036| 0109| 0263|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/07/22 11:12| 03 | 313| 044| 0393| 0727| 0115| 1953|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/07/22 11:12| 04 | 017| 032| 0317| 0060| 0191| 0372|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/07/22 11:01| 01 | 271| 008| 0520| 0644| 0359| 1839|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/07/22 07:12| 03 | 162| 030| 021"
